    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="37">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 37</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwa ymbe cyninges feorh syrwe, sy he his feores scyldig ⁊ ealles þæs þe he age, gif hit him ongesoþod weorðe; ⁊ gif he hine ladian wille ⁊ mage, do þæt be þam deopestan aðe oþþe mid þryfealdan ordale on Ængla lage, ⁊ on Dena lage be þam þe heora lagu sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone plots against the king's life, he shall forfeit his life and all that he possesses, if it is proved against him, and if he seeks and is able to clear himself, he shall do so by means of the most solemn oath or by the triple ordeal in districts under English law, and in those under Danish law in accordance with their constitution.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
